{"title": "Osric", "pageid": 2075, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Osric is son to <a href=\"/wiki/Oberon\" title=\"Oberon\">Oberon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cymnea\" title=\"Cymnea\">Cymnea</a> and full brother to <a href=\"/wiki/Benedict\" title=\"Benedict\">Benedict</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Finndo\" title=\"Finndo\">Finndo</a>. Little is mentioned of him in the main story. It is suggested that long ago he along with his brother Finndo attempted to take the throne from their father, after which they were sent to the front lines of a war from which they did not return.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Osric?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231353\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 318/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.864      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.864      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2075-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501231353 and revision id 4522. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Benedict", "exists": true}